  message: "GIVEN RESIDUAL RESOLVED via REUSE-INSTANCE (PR #52, dev e07f15f761). Human-directed 3-lens ADR/spec/spirit investigation (lab notebook concept-audit-scala-given-symbol-kind_07282026.md) verdict: emit the NAMED Scala 3 given owner as kind='instance' (the cross-language typeclass-instance canonical Haskell/Lean/PureScript already emit) — NOT a new 'given' kind (would fragment the canonical: ADR-0027 Cluster-27C apex/peer, same construct under multiple labels because analyzers each chose their own), and NOT kind='object' (conflation; four-leakage Test-2 fires). Added 'instance' to CONTAINER_KINDS (also roots Haskell/Lean/PureScript instance bodies). Broadened the instance kind description; regenerated concept-axes. Behavioral evidence: test_given_body_val_emits_field (named given -> kind='instance' owner 'intOrd' + intOrd.cached field), test_anonymous_given_emits_no_instance_owner, test_instance_owner_roots_field (containment linker roots a dotted field under an instance owner). Full slice green, 100% cov. No new kind value, no ADR, no schema bump. Re-eval trigger recorded. WI-pujiz COMPLETE: D-enum + scala-enum owners (PR #48) + scala-given owner (PR #52)."  # 3a59
